      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We need to frame CardioZen not just as an alternative, but as a superior, proactive choice for patients. When discussing side effects, emphasize our rigorous, proprietary testing that demonstrates a significantly lower incidence of adverse reactions compared to the competition. Focus the message on \"enhanced patient comfort and long-term adherence,\" positioning our profile as a benefit that directly translates to better outcomes. These talking points will allow your reps to pivot the conversation from risk assessment to superior patient experience.",
